# Notes and scratch JSON are ignored by default...
*.md
!README.md
!docs/**/*.md
!web_demo/*.md
*.json
!ontology/**/*.json

# ...but every result under outputs/ is tracked
!outputs/**/*.md
!outputs/**/*.json

